### Opening a node from its directory, and what goes wrong doing it.

node-opening-record = 正在打开这个节点的记录
node-reading-record = 正在读取这个节点的记录
node-does-not-verify = 这个节点自己的记录无法通过校验
node-opening-witnessed = 正在打开见证
node-opening-statements = 正在打开声明
node-opening-addresses = 正在打开地址
node-reading-addresses = 正在读取地址
node-writing = 正在写入 { $path }
